TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution in acidic solution at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    units     mmol/kgw
    density   1
    Cu        10
    Ba        5
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step SI_Witherite
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, SI("Witherite")
END
